==English==

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|sg=[[board]] [[game]]}}

# Any of many games of [[strategy]] or [[chance]] played on a specially designed [[board]]; often involves two or more opponents moving [[piece]]s and using [[dice]] or [[card]]s.

